Question: Given a drug SMILES string, predict whether it
(A) does not cross the BBB (B) crosses the BBB
Drug SMILES: CCC1NC(=O)C(NC(=O)c2ncccc2O)C(C)OC(=O)C(c2ccccc2)NC(=O)C2CC(=O)CCN2C(=O)C(Cc2ccc(N(C)C)cc2)N(C)C(=O)C2CCCN2C1=O
